  "html": "<div id=\"main\" class=\"b-main\"><div class=\"b-page-heading\"><div><span class=\"b-eyebrow\">PLATE ENHANCEMENT / THE SUGARSMITH</span><h1><span class=\"pe-title-icon\" data-pe-icon=\"sectionIcon\"></span>Plating Enhancement</h1><p>Check Plating probabilities, compare equipment bonuses, and plan Chocosteel and Metal Syrup.</p></div><a class=\"b-button b-button-light\" href=\"/data/tools/tables/PlateUpgradeResults.json\" download>View original configuration ↗</a></div>\r\n<p id=\"pe-loading\" class=\"b-note\" role=\"status\">Loading Plating data…</p><div id=\"plate-tool\" hidden>\r\n<section class=\"pe-workbench\"><header class=\"pe-game-head\"><div><span data-pe-icon=\"sectionIcon\"></span><h2>The Sugarsmith's workbench</h2><small>Local planner</small></div><div class=\"pe-material-head\"><span data-pe-icon=\"materials.steel\"></span><span>Chocosteel per attempt<strong id=\"pe-head-cost\">—</strong></span></div></header>\r\n<div class=\"pe-setup\"><label> Plating<select id=\"pe-plate\" aria-label=\" Plating\"></select></label><label>Current grade<select id=\"pe-current\" aria-label=\"Current grade\"></select></label><label>Target grade<select id=\"pe-target\" aria-label=\"Target grade\"></select></label></div>\r\n<div class=\"pe-main-grid\"><section class=\"pe-forge\"><div class=\"pe-forge-caption\"><span id=\"pe-forge-name\">Sword Plating</span><small id=\"pe-unlock\"></small></div><div class=\"pe-forge-scene\"><div class=\"pe-forge-halo\"></div><img id=\"pe-oven-art\" class=\"pe-oven\" alt=\"\" hidden><img id=\"pe-anvil\" class=\"pe-anvil\" alt=\"\" hidden><img id=\"pe-hammer\" class=\"pe-hammer\" alt=\"\" hidden><div class=\"pe-plate-preview\"><img id=\"pe-frame\" class=\"pe-plate-frame\" alt=\"\" hidden><img id=\"pe-plate-art\" class=\"pe-plate-art\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"pe-grade\" id=\"pe-grade-badge\">+10</span></div></div><div id=\"pe-stage-effects\" class=\"pe-stage-effects\"></div><p class=\"pe-forge-note\">Grades stay on the Plating; bonuses remain when you change equipment.</p></section>\r\n<section class=\"pe-rate-panel\"><div class=\"pe-section-head\"><h3>Next enhancement outcomes</h3><span id=\"pe-rate-grade\"></span></div><div id=\"pe-rates\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"pe-protection\"><label><input id=\"pe-protect-decline\" type=\"checkbox\"><span data-pe-icon=\"protection.decline\"></span><span>Prevent Downgrade<small id=\"pe-decline-cost\">Available from +10</small></span></label><label><input id=\"pe-protect-destroy\" type=\"checkbox\"><span data-pe-icon=\"protection.destroy\"></span><span>Reduce Break Chance<small id=\"pe-destroy-cost\">Available from +15</small></span></label></div><div id=\"pe-once-cost\" class=\"pe-once-cost\"></div><p id=\"pe-once-note\" class=\"pe-note\"></p><details class=\"pe-refund-history\"><summary>View recorded refund observation</summary><div id=\"pe-refund-example\"></div></details></section></div></section>\r\n<div class=\"pe-budget-note\" role=\"note\"><span data-pe-icon=\"materials.steel\"></span><div><strong>Material estimates show gross investment, before refunds</strong><p>Includes retries, selected protection and repairs. Refund materials and integer rules remain uncertain, so net costs are not estimated. Average investment is not a guaranteed material cap.</p></div></div><div class=\"pe-planner-grid\"><section class=\"pe-panel\"><h2><span data-pe-icon=\"sectionIcon\"></span>Compare target bonuses</h2><div id=\"pe-gain\" class=\"pe-gain\"></div><p class=\"pe-note\">Shows configured amplification of Main and Sub Effects, rather than a direct increase to total Cookie stats.</p><details><summary>Convert equipment effect values</summary><div class=\"pe-fields\"><label>Base Main Effect value<input id=\"pe-base-main\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"1000000000000\" step=\"any\" placeholder=\"e.g. 100\" aria-label=\"Base Main Effect value\"></label><label>Base Sub Effect value<input id=\"pe-base-sub\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"1000000000000\" step=\"any\" placeholder=\"e.g. 10\" aria-label=\"Base Sub Effect value\"></label></div><div id=\"pe-value-preview\"></div><p class=\"pe-note\">Reference: base value × (1 + amplification). Actual rounding follows the game.</p></details></section>\r\n<section class=\"pe-panel\"><h2><span data-pe-icon=\"materials.steel\"></span>To target · Average gross investment</h2><label class=\"pe-repair\"><input id=\"pe-repair\" type=\"checkbox\"><span data-pe-icon=\"materials.syrup\"></span>Repair every Break to the previous grade</label><div id=\"pe-expectation\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><p id=\"pe-model-note\" class=\"pe-note\"></p><p class=\"pe-note\">Calculated grade by grade using the chosen strategy and fixed probabilities, including retries after No Change, Downgrade and Break. Materials show average gross investment before refunds to compare protection and repair strategies.</p><details class=\"pe-rule-details\"><summary>Verified enhancement rules</summary><ul><li>Super +2, Upgrade +1, No Change +0, Downgrade −1, Break −2.</li><li>Prevent Downgrade: all Downgrade probability moves to No Change.</li><li>Reduce Break Chance: halves Break probability; the avoided half moves to No Change.</li><li>Neither protection increases Upgrade or Super probability. Results are capped at grades 0–25.</li></ul><p class=\"pe-note\">Verified against loaded client logic for 1.5.002. After a Break, pay separately to restore the previous grade. Material budgets remain probability models and do not deduct Super refunds.</p></details></section></div>\r\n<section class=\"pe-panel\"><div class=\"pe-section-head\"><h2><span data-pe-icon=\"outcomes.success\"></span>Plan attempt count</h2><span>Stop at target</span></div><div class=\"pe-fields\"><label>Maximum attempts<input id=\"pe-attempts\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"1000000\" step=\"1\" aria-label=\"Maximum attempts\"></label><label>Break handling<select id=\"pe-recovery-mode\" aria-label=\"Break handling\"><option value=\"repair\">Pay for every repair</option><option value=\"accept\">Accept the post-Break grade</option></select></label></div><div id=\"pe-attempt-plan\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><p class=\"pe-note\">Planning model with a fixed strategy and independent draws. Assumes enough materials for the plan and stops at or above the target. Average gross investment excludes refunds; actual spending varies and this is not a guaranteed material cap.</p></section>\r\n<div class=\"pe-save-bar\"><button id=\"pe-save\" class=\"b-button\" type=\"button\">Save Plating progress</button><button id=\"pe-share\" class=\"b-button b-button-light\" type=\"button\">Copy plan link</button><button id=\"pe-export\" class=\"b-button b-button-light\" type=\"button\">Export plan JSON</button><label id=\"pe-share-field\" hidden>Plan link<input id=\"pe-share-url\" readonly aria-label=\"Plating plan link\"></label><p id=\"pe-save-note\" class=\"b-note\">Current grades for each Plating stay in this browser.</p><details id=\"pe-json-panel\" hidden><summary>View / copy plan JSON</summary><textarea id=\"pe-json\" readonly rows=\"9\" aria-label=\"Plating plan JSON\"></textarea><button id=\"pe-copy-json\" class=\"b-button b-button-light\" type=\"button\">Copy JSON</button></details></div>\r\n<section class=\"pe-panel\"><div class=\"pe-section-head\"><h2>12 Plating progress slots</h2><label class=\"pe-oven-label\">Oven level<input id=\"pe-oven\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"1000\" step=\"1\" aria-label=\"Oven level\"></label></div><p class=\"pe-note\">Choose a Plating to continue. Every type uses the same probability, cost and amplification curves; grades are recorded separately.</p><div id=\"pe-inventory\" class=\"pe-inventory\"></div></section>\r\n<section class=\"pe-panel\"><div class=\"pe-section-head\"><h2>Grade-by-grade configuration</h2><a href=\"/data/tools/tables/PlateUpgradeCosts.csv\" download>Costs CSV ↓</a></div><div class=\"b-table-wrap\" id=\"pe-grade-table\"></div><p class=\"pe-note\">Fees are for one attempt from the listed grade. The current configured cap is +25.</p><details class=\"b-raw\"><summary>Official guide, sources and calculations</summary><div id=\"pe-evidence\"></div><p class=\"pe-note\">Checked 2026-10-16: all 125 unprotected probabilities for grades 0–24 match the official table. Its rounding note concerns published probability precision, not material refund rounding or protection-material eligibility.<a href=\"https://cs-cookieruncrumble.devsisters.com/hc/zh-tw/articles/60508500007449-%E7%B3%96%E7%AC%A6%E6%96%87-%E8%A3%9D%E5%82%99%E7%9B%A4%E5%BC%B7%E5%8C%96%E6%A9%9F%E7%8E%87%E8%A9%B3%E6%83%85\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Official probability notes ↗</a> · <a href=\"/data/tools/verification/official-sugar-plate-comparison-20261016.json\" download>Item-by-item comparison ↓</a></p><div class=\"b-actions\"><a href=\"/data/tools/tables/PlateEnhanceGrades.json\" download>Amplification JSON ↓</a><a href=\"/data/tools/tables/PlateUpgradeResults.csv\" download>Probabilities CSV ↓</a><a href=\"/data/tools/plate-enhancement.json\" download>Tool data JSON ↓</a></div></details></section>\r\n</div></div><div id=\"book-toast\" class=\"b-toast\" role=\"status\" hidden></div>"
}
